{"4763220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ONE SKILL - Drive or Fall", "steam_appid": 4763220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4768060], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763220/extras/1be32ea8eda38e5df61c4498f75a738e.poster.avif?t=1787749327\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763220/extras/1be32ea8eda38e5df61c4498f75a738e.webm?t=1787749327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763220/extras/1be32ea8eda38e5df61c4498f75a738e.mp4?t=1787749327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forget everything you know about high-speed chaos. This is not a race against time—it’s a battle against physics, geometry, and your own nerves.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the ultimate test of pure driving mastery. Suspended high above the clouds lies a complex network of mind-bending platforms, narrow beams, and treacherous obstacles designed to challenge even the most seasoned drivers. One wrong move, one over-steer, or a split-second loss of focus will send you plummeting into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763220/extras/fd961f3ca4e86c6332231b2d0cad2ffe.poster.avif?t=1787749327\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763220/extras/fd961f3ca4e86c6332231b2d0cad2ffe.webm?t=1787749327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763220/extras/fd961f3ca4e86c6332231b2d0cad2ffe.mp4?t=1787749327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Over Pace:</strong> Speed won't save you here. Success requires absolute control, careful throttle management, and a deep understanding of your vehicle's physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate Sky Platforms:</strong> Navigate through a series of uniquely crafted levels, featuring shifting elements, tight corners, and vertical challenges that demand creative maneuvering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Skill Test:</strong> Every level is a puzzle on wheels. Read the terrain, plan your path, and execute your maneuvers with millimeter precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes, High Reward:</strong> Experience the heart-pounding tension of navigating perilous situations where patience is your greatest weapon, and flawless execution is the only way out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763220/extras/271334a0b8ddd7b85a3b604465b2824a.poster.avif?t=1787749327\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763220/extras/271334a0b8ddd7b85a3b604465b2824a.webm?t=1787749327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4763220/extras/271334a0b8ddd7b85a3b604465b2824a.mp4?t=1787749327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have the steady hands and the tactical mind to conquer the skies? Step into the driver’s seat and prove your skill!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_